# 统一换行：gradlew / .sh 若被转成 CRLF，在 Linux/macOS CI 上会直接跑不起来
* text=auto
gradlew text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.kts text eol=lf
*.kt text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.properties text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf

*.xml text

